WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:16.750
The United States Coast Pilot, published by NOAA, supplements the chart with information that can’t be drawn on it: navigation regulations, local hazards, anchorages, bridge and cable clearances, currents, weather, and descriptions of ports and channels.

2
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.300
It comes in nine volumes.

3
00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:30.750
Coast Pilot four covers the Atlantic coast from Cape Henry, Virginia, to Key West, and Coast Pilot five covers the Gulf coast, Puerto Rico and the Virgin Islands.

4
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.500
Read the relevant chapters before you run a new inlet or harbor.

5
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:39.150
It’s free to download and updated regularly.
